PCT compatibility usage
=======================

This directory is source/tooling only. Do not start navigation by running ROS
launch files or ROS PCT planner nodes from here.

Current navigation flow:

  goal_pose + odometry + map
    -> Navigation
    -> GlobalPlanner
    -> planner backend
    -> global_path / waypoint
    -> LocalPlanner

Product backend:

  octoplanner3d

Compatibility backend:

  pct

Use the compatibility backend only through LingTu runtime/profile config or
focused tests. Direct ROS commands such as `ros2 launch pct_planner ...` and
`ros2 run pct_adapters pct_path_adapter` are intentionally unsupported in this
tree.

Useful checks:

  python -m pytest src/nav/tests/planning_backends/test_pct_planner.py -q
  python -m pytest src/nav/tests/planning_backends/test_pct_planner_wrapper_static.py -q
